# LuxSecure stack

- Laravel 10, PHP 8.1+, Blade, Tailwind CSS 4 (Vite), Alpine.js, Sanctum, PHPUnit, MySQL.
- No Bootstrap. No Tailwind CDN.
- Prefer existing routes/controllers/models; UI-first unless the task says otherwise.
- Use `x-container`, design tokens (`fs-*`), and shared `resources/views/components/*`.
- Spec sources: `PRD.md`, `progress.txt` (append-only), `.planning/STATE.md`, `AGENTS.md`.
- Before completing a PRD task: `php -l` on changed PHP, `php artisan test`, and `npm run build` if frontend changed.
- Do not commit or push unless the user explicitly asks.
